  "description": "12 companies ranked, no emotions 🥶 22 January 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>In this episode we ranked 12 different companies. In a relaxed process, we reviewed earnings, revenue, technical analysis and some fundamental factors that are at play, including Trump’s crypto task force charge to the SEC. I am not invested in any of these companies, making this review completely unbiased. </p><p>If you have any questions, ask in the chat!</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy James&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
